        "original_id": "ac3d663c-a635-526e-9d61-b28a543f01f3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Philadelphia Eagles\n- Seasons: 2004 Philadelphia Eagles season, 2005 Philadelphia Eagles season\n- Organizations: NFC East\n- Events: NFC Championship Games, Super Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2004 season, the Philadelphia Eagles swept their NFC East division rivals.\n- In the 2004 season, the Philadelphia Eagles were favored in the final two NFC title games but did not reach the Super Bowl.\n- In the 2005 season, the Philadelphia Eagles became the first team to reverse a divisional sweep by going 0–6 against the NFC East after sweeping the division the previous year.",
