        "text": "Page: 2005 Philadelphia Eagles season. Sentence: In the 2004 season, Philadelphia had swept its division rivals, but they became the first team to reverse that feat in its next season, going 0–6 against the NFC East in 2005.\nPage: 2004 Philadelphia Eagles season. Sentence: However, the team could not reach the Super Bowl, despite being favored in the final two NFC title games.",
